OL,3,ACanada is a 'safe harbour' for global
OL,4,Afinance, Carney says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Mark Carney has pitched
OL,7,FCanada as a "safe harbour" for some of
OL,8,Fthe world's largest investors to spend
OL,9,Ftheir money in an era of geopolitical
OL,10,Fand economic uncertainty.
OL,12,FThe country is "perfectly situated to
OL,13,Fbuild in the new global economic
OL,14,Forder", he told more than 100 global
OL,15,Finvestors and sovereign wealth fund
OL,16,Frepresentatives gathered in Toronto for
OL,17,Fa major investment summit.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
