OL,3,ACanada is a 'safe harbour' for global
OL,4,Afinance, Carney says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group represent more than C$120tn
OL,7,F($86tn; #64tn) of assets. Carney's
OL,8,Fambition is that they will invest in
OL,9,Fsectors like defence, energy, mining,
OL,10,FAI and infrastructure.
OL,12,FOttawa hopes they can be sold on more
OL,13,Fthan 160 projects, from data centres to
OL,14,Fpipelines, and help Canada weather its
OL,15,Ftrade war with the US.
